        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Descend on a Web"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(move)\n\nThe goliath spider moves straight down up to 120 feet, suspended by a web line. It can hang from the web or drop off. The distance it Descends on a Web doesn't count for falling damage. A creature that successfully Strikes the web (AC 20, Hardness 5, 20 HP) severs it, causing the spider to fall."
            },
            "id": "66b0fe36-f9b5-4b70-82fa-1f38e7cc0804",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:50.064440"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Goliath Spider Venom"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "**Goliath Spider Venom**\nDC: 30\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\nMaximum Duration: 6 rounds\n- Stage 1: 2d6 poison and slowed 1 (1 round)\n- Stage 2: 2d6 poison and slowed 2 (1 round)\n- Stage 3: paralyzed for 2d4 hours."
            },
            "id": "f68bf2bb-432f-44db-a440-e041f04d86a4",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:58:50.064440"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Web Tether"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A creature hit by the spider's web Strike is restrained and tethered to the spider, preventing it from moving farther away from the spider. The spider can have one creature tethered at a time. The DC to Escape or Force Open the web is 30. The tether can be severed with a Strike (AC 20, Hardness 5, HP 20), but this doesn't free the restrained creature."
            },
            "id": "2e72b4f2-2341-40e3-bc1b-e1d2501acb33",
            "updated_at": {
